<article class="node node--type-news node--promoted node--view-mode-side-teaser">
  <div class="related-news-card">
    <div class="rel-news-title">
      <a href="/press-news/esma-news/new-investment-funds-drive-reduction-costs-investors" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">New investment funds drive reduction in costs to investors</span>
</a>
    </div>
    

    <div class="node__content">
      <div class="rel-news-date"> 03 Mar 2026 </div>
      <div class="rel-news-intro">
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-news-introduction field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p class="text-align-justify"><span>The European Securities and Markets Authority (ESMA), the EU financial markets regulator and supervisor, today publishes its </span><a href="/sites/default/files/20"></a></p></div>
      </div>
